Leave the sewing to the women.

277
00:19:20,954 --> 00:19:22,454
You go get some trimmin'.

278
00:19:22,539 --> 00:19:26,458
And we'll make
a lovely dress for Cinderelly, whoo

279
00:19:26,543 --> 00:19:29,295
We'll make a lovely dress
for Cinderelly

280
00:19:29,379 --> 00:19:31,672
Follow me, Gus-Gus.
I know where to go.

281
00:19:31,756 --> 00:19:34,175
It's gonna be pretty, this dress.

282
