Cinderelly will be surprised.

283
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:39,471
Surprised, surprised. Very surprised.

284
00:19:47,856 --> 00:19:50,524
And this, too, my slippers.
Don't forget...

285
00:19:50,609 --> 00:19:52,985
