- When you're through,

288
00:19:58,366 --> 00:20:01,160
and before you begin
your regular chores,

289
00:20:01,244 --> 00:20:02,995
I have a few little things.

290
00:20:03,079 --> 00:20:04,330
Very well.

291
00:20:04,414 --> 00:20:07,833
I don't see why everyone else
has nice things to wear,

292
00:20:07,918 --> 00:20:10,002
and I always end up in these old rags.

293
00:20:10,086 --> 00:20:13,005
This sash! I wouldn't be seen dead in it.

294
00:20:13,089 --> 00:20:15,341
You should talk. These beads!

295
00:20:15,425 --> 00:20:16,759
I am sick of looking at them.

296
00:20:17,260 --> 00:20:19,470
- Trash.
- Oh, I hate this.

297
00:20:23,141 --> 00:20:25,184
Come on and be careful.

298
00:20:25,268 --> 00:20:28,604
Yes, yes, yes. Real careful.

299
00:20:38,615 --> 00:20:40,574
We can use that, Gus-Gus.

300
00:20:40,951 --> 00:20:42,701
Pretty, pretty.

301
00:20:42,786 --> 00:20:44,995
Look out. Lucify!

302
00:21:31,626 --> 00:21:33,419
Beads!

303
00:21:33,503 --> 00:21:35,963
Very pretty beads!

304
00:23:40,088 --> 00:23:43,715
A dream is a wish your heart makes

305
00:23:43,800 --> 00:23:47,719
When you're fast asleep

306
00:23:47,804 --> 00:23:49,389
In dreams you will lose
your heartaches

307
