Oh, well.

308
00:23:50,807 --> 00:23:52,641
What's a royal ball?

309
00:23:54,561 --> 00:23:57,646
After all, I suppose
it would be frightfully dull,

310
00:23:57,731 --> 00:24:01,233
and boring, and completely...

311
00:24:01,985 --> 00:24:03,944
Completely wonderful.

312
00:24:12,162 --> 00:24:14,121
- It's my...
- Surprise!

313
00:24:14,206 --> 00:24:16,040
- Surprise!
- Surprise!

314
00:24:17,459 --> 00:24:19,585
- Happy birthday!
- No, no, no, no!

315
00:24:19,669 --> 00:24:22,087
Well, I never dreamed it.

316
00:24:22,172 --> 00:24:24,757
It's such a surprise.

317
00:24:25,008 --> 00:24:28,344
Oh, how can I ever...

318
00:24:29,054 --> 00:24:31,472
Oh, thank you so much.

319
00:24:38,522 --> 00:24:41,106
Remember, when you're
presented to His Highness,

320
00:24:41,191 --> 00:24:42,858
