- Wait!

321
00:24:43,860 --> 00:24:45,653
Please, wait for me.

322
00:24:46,530 --> 00:24:49,366
Isn't it lovely? Do you like it?

323
00:24:49,366 --> 00:24:50,199
- Oh, but I'm not...
- Of course, you are.

324
00:24:50,283 --> 00:24:51,659
But we have to hurry,

325
00:24:51,743 --> 00:24:53,994
because even miracles take a little time.

326
00:24:54,079 --> 00:24:57,581
- Miracles?
- Watch.

327
00:24:57,666 --> 00:25:00,626
What in the world did I do
with that magic wand? I was sure...

328
00:25:00,710 --> 00:25:01,877
Magic wand?

329
00:25:01,962 --> 00:25:03,546
That's strange.

330
00:25:03,630 --> 00:25:06,340
- I always...
- Then you must be...

331
00:25:06,424 --> 00:25:09,552
Your fairy godmother? Of course.

332
00:25:09,636 --> 00:25:12,012
Where is that wand? I...

333
