- a pumpkin.
- A pumpkin?

340
00:25:30,907 --> 00:25:34,451
Now the magic words.

341
00:25:39,457 --> 00:25:44,378
Sala-gadoola-menchika-boo-la
Bibbidi-bobbidi-boo

342
00:25:44,462 --> 00:25:46,547
Put 'em together
and what have you got?

343
00:25:46,631 --> 00:25:48,674
Bibbidi-bobbidi-boo

344
00:25:48,758 --> 00:25:53,220
Sala-gadoola-menchika-boo-la
Bibbidi-bobbidi-boo

345
00:25:53,305 --> 00:25:55,556
It'll do magic
Believe it or not

346
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:57,725
Bibbidi-bobbidi-boo

347
