Now sala-gadoola means
Menchika-boolaroo

348
00:26:02,314 --> 00:26:04,732
But the thing-a-ma-bob
that does the job

349
00:26:04,816 --> 00:26:07,443
Is bibbidi-bobbidi-boo

350
00:26:07,527 --> 00:26:12,072
Sala-gadoola-menchika-boo-la
Bibbidi-bobbidi-boo

351
00:26:12,157 --> 00:26:14,241
Put 'em together
and what have you got?

352
00:26:14,326 --> 00:26:18,203
Bibbidi-bobbidi
Bibbidi-bobbidi Bibbidi-bobbidi-boo

353
00:26:19,664 --> 00:26:20,956
Oh, looky.

354
00:26:21,041 --> 00:26:22,833
Isn't it wonderful?

355
00:26:23,668 --> 00:26:25,961
Oh, it's beautiful.

356
00:26:26,046 --> 00:26:28,464
Yes, isn't it?

357
00:26:28,548 --> 00:26:30,966
With an elegant coach like that,
of course,

358
00:26:31,051 --> 00:26:33,844
we'll simply have to have

359
00:26:34,179 --> 00:26:36,722
- mice!
- Mice?

360
00:26:36,806 --> 00:26:39,266
Oh, this really is nice.

361
00:26:39,351 --> 00:26:42,436
Why, we'll have a coach
and four when we're through.

362
00:26:42,520 --> 00:26:45,981
Just a wave of my stick
and to finish the trick,

363
00:26:46,066 --> 00:26:48,984
bibbidi, bobbidi, boo.

364
00:26:49,069 --> 00:26:51,111
Gracious, what did I do?

365
00:26:51,196 --> 00:26:54,990
I was sure there were four.
There should be one more.

366
00:26:55,075 --> 00:26:57,076
There you are.

367
00:26:58,453 --> 00:27:00,579
Bibbidi, bobbidi, boo.

368
00:27:10,882 --> 00:27:13,092
Oh, poor Lucifer.

369
00:27:13,176 --> 00:27:15,469
Serves him right, I'd say. Now...

370
00:27:15,553 --> 00:27:18,472
Where were we? Oh, goodness, yes.

371
00:27:18,556 --> 00:27:21,100
You can't go to the ball without

372
00:27:21,184 --> 00:27:22,643
a horse.

373
00:27:22,727 --> 00:27:24,228
Another one?

374
00:27:24,729 --> 00:27:28,399
But tonight, for a change,
you will handle the reins,

375
00:27:28,483 --> 00:27:30,901
and sit in the driver's seat, too.

376
00:27:31,361 --> 00:27:34,947
For instead of a horse,
you're the coachman, of course.

377
00:27:35,031 --> 00:27:36,949
Bibbidi, bobbidi, boo.

378
00:27:41,037 --> 00:27:44,498
That does it, I guess, except for...
Oh, yes!

379
00:27:44,582 --> 00:27:47,710
The finishing touch. And, that's you.

380
00:27:47,794 --> 00:27:51,588
Yes, Bruno, that's right,
you'll be footman tonight.

381
00:27:51,923 --> 00:27:54,258
Bibbidi, bobbidi, boo.

382
00:27:55,802 --> 00:27:58,262
Well, well, hop in, my dear.
We can't waste time.

383
00:27:58,346 --> 00:28:01,056
- But...
- No, don't try to thank me.

384
00:28:01,141 --> 00:28:04,810
Oh, I wasn't... I mean, I do, but...

385
00:28:04,894 --> 00:28:06,562
But, don't you think my dress...

386
00:28:06,646 --> 00:28:09,481
Yes, it's lovely, dear.

387
00:28:09,566 --> 00:28:13,485
Good heavens, child.
You can't go in that!

388
00:28:15,113 --> 00:28:17,364
Now, let's see, dear.

389
00:28:17,449 --> 00:28:21,702
Your size and the shade of your eyes.

390
00:28:21,786 --> 00:28:24,913
Something simple, but daring, too.

391
00:28:24,998 --> 00:28:28,751
Oh, just leave it to me.
What a gown this will be.

392
00:28:29,210 --> 00:28:31,462
Bibbidi-bobbidi.
Bibbidi-bobbidi.

393
00:28:31,546 --> 00:28:33,881
Bibbidi-bobbidi-boo.

394
00:28:36,134 --> 00:28:39,344
Oh, it's a beautiful dress.

395
00:28:39,429 --> 00:28:42,639
Did you ever see
such a beautiful dress?

396
00:28:42,724 --> 00:28:45,476
And, look, glass slippers.

397
00:28:47,228 --> 00:28:49,396
Why, it's like a dream.

398
00:28:49,481 --> 00:28:52,399
A wonderful dream come true.

399
00:28:52,484 --> 00:28:54,067
Yes, my child.

400
00:28:54,152 --> 00:28:55,819
But, like all dreams,

401
00:28:55,904 --> 00:28:58,697
well, I'm afraid this can't last forever.

402
00:28:58,782 --> 00:29:00,824
You'll have only till midnight, and then...

403
00:29:00,909 --> 00:29:02,493
Midnight? Thank you.

404
00:29:02,577 --> 00:29:05,954
Now, now, now, just a minute.
You must understand, my dear,

405
00:29:06,039 --> 00:29:09,249
